WEBVTT

00:00:11.518 --> 00:00:13.638
We have to tell the others.
我们得去告诉其他人

00:00:14.358 --> 00:00:17.758
-We can't just leave him!
-Lucy, there's no time.
我们不能把他丢在这儿
露西 没有时间了

00:00:18.358 --> 00:00:20.038
They need to know.
他们需要知道这个消息

00:00:26.838 --> 00:00:28.278
The trees.
让那些树帮忙

00:00:33.078 --> 00:00:35.878
(LEAVES RUSTLING)

00:01:09.238 --> 00:01:10.238
(GASPS)

00:01:13.038 --> 00:01:14.878
Be still, my Princes.
别紧张 王子

00:01:16.678 --> 00:01:19.438
I bring grave news from your sisters.
你的姐妹们让我
带来一个不幸的消息

00:01:23.558 --> 00:01:25.318
(PEOPLE CHATTERING)

00:01:35.238 --> 00:01:36.878
She's right.
她说的对

00:01:40.198 --> 00:01:41.758
He's gone.
他死了

00:01:47.758 --> 00:01:49.958
Then you'll have to lead us.
那样的话你就得带领我们

00:01:51.798 --> 00:01:56.758
Peter, there's an army out there
and it's ready to follow you.
彼得 军队就在外面
等候你的号令

00:01:57.158 --> 00:01:59.838
-I can't.
-Aslan believed you could.
我做不到
亚斯蓝相信你能做到

00:02:03.718 --> 00:02:05.278
And so do I.
我也相信

00:02:12.878 --> 00:02:16.838
The Witch's army is nearing, sire.
What are your orders?
女巫的军队正在逼近 陛下
您有什么指示？

00:02:30.238 --> 00:02:32.638
(SCREECHING)

00:03:02.758 --> 00:03:03.958
They come, Your Highness,
他们人数众多 武器精良

00:03:04.118 --> 00:03:06.438
in numbers and weapons
far greater than our own.
他们人数众多 武器精良

00:03:06.598 --> 00:03:08.438
Numbers do not win a battle.
光凭人多并不能赢得战争

00:03:08.598 --> 00:03:11.958
No. But I bet they help.
对 但人多还是会有所帮助

00:03:17.238 --> 00:03:18.238
(GROWLING)

00:03:18.398 --> 00:03:19.398
(ROARING)

00:03:33.798 --> 00:03:35.118
(ROARING)

00:04:27.438 --> 00:04:28.638
(SIGHS)

00:04:32.598 --> 00:04:34.078
(HORN BLOWING)

00:04:34.238 --> 00:04:36.198
(ALL CHEERING)

00:04:42.518 --> 00:04:45.118
I have no interest in prisoners.
我对俘虏没有兴趣

00:04:45.278 --> 00:04:46.678
Kill them all.
把他们杀得片甲不留

00:04:46.878 --> 00:04:48.278
(ROARING)
把他们杀得片甲不留

00:05:36.558 --> 00:05:37.998
Go on!
冲啊

00:05:38.678 --> 00:05:39.998
(SCREECHING)

00:05:44.278 --> 00:05:46.318
Look to the sky!
注意天上

00:05:46.758 --> 00:05:48.638
Watch out!
注意天上

00:06:13.918 --> 00:06:15.558
Are you with me?
你会跟我来吗？

00:06:16.998 --> 00:06:18.438
To the death.
誓死追随

00:06:21.718 --> 00:06:26.118
For Narnia and for Aslan!
为了纳尼亚 为了亚斯蓝

00:06:29.878 --> 00:06:31.558
Go!
冲啊

00:06:33.638 --> 00:06:35.238
Go!
冲啊 为了亚斯蓝

